    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_360b4729",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: enjoying_in_beach; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes a person relaxing on a beach (top image) with a desert canyon landscape (bottom image), with the text \"enjoying in beach\". The intent is to create a humorous or ironic contrast, implying that the person is not actually on a beach but in a desert, thus mocking the idea of 'enjoying' a beach vacation. This is a harmless visual pun or joke, not targeting any specific group or individual with harmful intent. The humor stems from the visual misalignment between the text and the image, not from any toxic or harmful content related to protected characteristics or communities.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6074b1c3"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
