      "instance_name": "beach_vacation_stereotype",
      "label": "Beach Vacation Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the common cultural stereotype that 'beach vacation' implies a relaxing, idyllic, and leisurely experience, often associated with tropical or coastal environments. This stereotype is contrasted with the desert canyon scene to create humor. Understanding this stereotype is necessary to appreciate the irony of the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
