      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "desert_canyon_landscape",
      "label": "Desert Canyon Landscape",
      "description": "The bottom image depicts a desert canyon, which is not a typical beach environment. This geographical contrast is central to the meme's humor. Background knowledge about desert landscapes and their association with arid, rugged, and non-beach-like environments is required to understand the visual pun.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
