      "instance_name": "visual_pun",
      "label": "Visual Pun",
      "description": "The meme uses a visual pun — the juxtaposition of a beach relaxation scene with a desert canyon — to create humor. This requires understanding the concept of visual puns as a form of wordplay or irony in visual media, which is a common trope in internet memes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_6074b1c3"
