      "label": "general internet meme audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with visual puns and ironic juxtapositions common in online humor. It relies on universal cultural understanding of beach vacations and desert landscapes, making it accessible to anyone who appreciates light-hearted, visual satire without targeting any specific demographic or community.",
